# Database Conventions

- Use SQLAlchemy 2.x `Mapped` / `mapped_column` syntax for models
- Place models in `app/db/models/` and import them in `app/db/base.py`
- Use snake_case for table and column names
- Write migrations manually — never use `alembic revision --autogenerate`
- Create revisions with `pipenv run alembic revision -m "description"` and edit by hand
- Alembic runs sync via `psycopg2`; the app uses async `asyncpg` — do not mix drivers in app code
